     version 2 or later (licenses/GPL-2.0.txt), with the additional permission stated at the top of psxfe.c.
   - game/sys/psxfe contains PCSX ReARMed (GNU GPL v2). The whole program is distributed under the GNU GPL v2.
     Source: source/launcher + source/cores (upstream commit and patch).
   - game/sys/snesfe contains Snes9x 2010, distributed under the Snes9x licence (licenses/Snes9x-LICENSE.txt):
     non-commercial use only. Source: source/launcher + source/cores (upstream commit and patch).
   - stb_image.h and stb_truetype.h (Sean Barrett): public domain / MIT, see the end of each file.
   - libretro.h: MIT, see the file.

2. Everything else written for this project - mod/command.sh, game/lansator.sh, source/mkbridge,
